{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無限勁食3小時!爆膏鹽焗蟹+燒生蠔</p><p>人氣日式放題進駐觀塘apm！</p><p>人氣日式放題「極．大瀛喜」正式進駐觀塘apm！最平$288起即可任食過百款美食，包括海膽拖羅手卷、油鹽焗蟹、芝士焗龍蝦伊麵、即開榴槤等，仲有自助區多款熱食、甜品和飲品，性價比極高！</p><p>回本位！任食即開榴槤！</p><p>放題提供A及B兩款菜單選擇，放題A餐可任食常規美食，其中焦點是任食新鮮即開榴槤；而放題B餐則可以額外任食不少矜貴菜式：如拖羅刺身、海膽拖羅蓉TACO、油鹽焗鮮蟹、上湯芝士焗龍蝦伊麵、櫻桃鵝肝等。午市放題低至$288，食足三小時；而晚市放題低至$388，可以任食兩小時。新張優惠即日起至7月底，晚市任何時段食放題B餐即減$20！</p><p>$288起任食過百款美食</p><p>除了B餐的矜貴菜式外，A餐都有不少回本料理，包括藍鰭吞拿魚刺身、松葉蟹腳、焦糖鵝肝壽司、金不換凍蜆、油鹽焗大頭蝦、金蒜奶油炒鮮肉蟹、海皇一品冬瓜盅、燒生蠔、燒乳鴿等。另外還有過百款放題美食，包括刺身、壽司、串燒、煮物、天婦羅、鐵板燒、甜品，包你食到飽一飽！</p><p>極．大瀛喜 地址：觀塘觀塘道418號創紀之城五期(apm)5樓L5-8號舖 電話： 3188 3212 / 3188 3213 營業時間：星期一至日 12:00 – 15:00，17:00 – 23:00</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178452013757689539_18971428066a5d9dca06506.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178452013945141529_15312940786a5d9dcc1a2a8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/17845201416972168_14236076856a5d9dce936ea.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178452014425960182_2259381786a5d9dd0d0112.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178452014686086825_20057511516a5d9dd352842.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178452014893627766_17562417906a5d9dd798bd7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178452015289981317_1173745326a5d9dd95f927.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178452015473673140_6292562596a5d9ddb2f5ae.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178452015676871800_18676941416a5d9ddd90dc7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-20T04:19:27.312997+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":621,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}